<i>- He closes off right side.</i>
<i>tied up.</i>

21
00:00:58.492 --> 00:01:00.762
<i>In the big bodies.</i>
<i>Goes baseline to Arnold</i>

22
00:01:00.795 --> 00:01:02.396
<i>who drives it--</i>

23
00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:09.837
- Call 911!

24
00:01:09.938 --> 00:01:11.104
- What? Why?

25
00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:12.907
What's wrong?

26
00:01:18.947 --> 00:01:20.080
- Good evening. Katie.

27
00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:21.415
- Detectives. good to see you.

28
00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:22.750
- This a drowning?
We hear that right?

29
00:01:22.817 --> 00:01:24.217
- Attempted.

30
00:01:24.251 --> 00:01:25.987
EMTs resuscitated the vic.
rushed him over to Sinai.

31
00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:27.655
- Okay.
Any idea how he's doing?

32
00:01:27.722 --> 00:01:29.057
- Above my pay grade.

33
00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:31.960
But if I were you guys.
I wouldn't hold my breath.

34
00:01:32.026 --> 00:01:33.628
Sorry. that's not what I meant.

35
00:01:33.728 --> 00:01:35.095
- Don't worry about it.

36
00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.067
- Bound and dumped in a tub.

37
00:01:39.132 --> 00:01:40.735
You ever seen
anything like this?

38
00:01:40.802 --> 00:01:42.336
- Nope.
This is a first.

39
00:01:42.436 --> 00:01:43.538
- Lucky us.

40
00:01:43.605 --> 00:01:46.074
- Front desk said that
he checked in under John Smith.

41
00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:47.575
and he paid cash.

42
00:01:47.675 --> 00:01:50.177
- All right. so pseudonym.
skeevy hotel with hourly rates.

43
00:01:50.277 --> 00:01:51.646
- You think our vic was a pro?

44
00:01:51.746 --> 00:01:53.180
- Or the client.

45
00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:54.983
- It fits with the booze.
oil. condoms.

46
00:01:55.016 --> 00:01:56.751
and a healthy amount of coke.

47
00:01:56.818 --> 00:01:58.720
- Okay. so party gone wrong?

48
00:01:58.753 --> 00:02:00.153
- No wallet. no phone.

49
00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:02.489
- All right. let's get unis
to canvass the neighborhood.

50
00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:03.758
pull footage.

51
00:02:03.858 --> 00:02:05.325
I mean. there's always a chance
that they dumped it nearby.

52
00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:06.794
- Okay. hang on a second.

53
00:02:06.828 --> 00:02:08.228
Hang on.

54
00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:10.531
We got party favors.

55
00:02:10.632 --> 00:02:15.603
Zip ties. a box cutter.
and a snub nose.

56
00:02:15.637 --> 00:02:17.805
- Oh. so somebody brought
a kill bag to the party.

57
00:02:17.872 --> 00:02:19.473
- Which suggests that it wasn't
a crime of passion.

58
00:02:19.507 --> 00:02:21.375
- Yeah. but why leave
the bag behind?

59
00:02:21.475 --> 00:02:23.044
The vic wasn't stabbed or shot.

60
00:02:23.111 --> 00:02:25.212
- Maybe the perp got excited.
panicked.

61
00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:27.381
- Unless--unless
it wasn't his bag.

62
00:02:27.481 --> 00:02:30.551
- Well. whose ever stuff
this is.

63
00:02:30.618 --> 00:02:34.689
there is something seriously
wrong with 'em.

64
00:02:34.722 --> 00:02:35.890
- Wow.

65
00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:43.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
