514
00:22:33.654 --> 00:22:36.123
- Well. you certainly
go the extra mile.

515
00:22:36.190 --> 00:22:38.626
- Clients love
a personal touch.

516
00:22:38.659 --> 00:22:41.028
- That's curious phrasing.

517
00:22:41.095 --> 00:22:45.233
considering that Clint O'Neill
sexually abuses teenage boys.

518
00:22:45.333 --> 00:22:47.367
- The hell he does.
That's a ridiculous claim.

519
00:22:47.467 --> 00:22:49.170
I never heard such a thing.
- Come on. Sharon.

520
00:22:49.270 --> 00:22:50.705
We know that you paid
a settlement

521
