to prove it.

526
00:23:04.819 --> 00:23:08.623
So. yeah. I expect you
to know who that is.

527
00:23:08.723 --> 00:23:13.327
- Okay. yeah. maybe that
name sounds familiar.

528
00:23:13.426 --> 00:23:14.762
You don't understand.

529
00:23:14.862 --> 00:23:15.830
I know Clint.

530
00:23:15.930 --> 00:23:17.231
He isn't capable of that.

531
00:23:17.331 --> 00:23:20.234
- What makes you so sure?

532
00:23:20.334 --> 00:23:22.336
- Clint's more than
just my client.

533
00:23:22.370 --> 00:23:25.239
