a stroll around the city.

552
00:24:15.623 --> 00:24:17.391
After I paid the bill.

553
00:24:17.457 --> 00:24:21.494
I saw Clint left his phone
on the table.

554
00:24:21.529 --> 00:24:24.565
I brought it back to his hotel.

555
00:24:24.632 --> 00:24:26.400
I left it with the front desk.

556
00:24:26.466 --> 00:24:31.172
