answer some questions.

568
00:25:04.705 --> 00:25:07.041
- You guys can see
I'm busy. right?

569
00:25:07.141 --> 00:25:08.542
We can talk another time.

570
00:25:08.576 --> 00:25:09.777
- No. it's best
for all involved

571
00:25:09.844 --> 00:25:11.612
