572
00:25:11.712 --> 00:25:12.980
- Everything okay. Clint?

573
00:25:13.047 --> 00:25:14.882
- Yeah. Yep.
Just give me a second.

574
00:25:14.949 --> 00:25:16.751
- Or if you'd rather.
Clint. we can explain

575
00:25:16.851 --> 00:25:18.352
to these nice people
how much you like

576
00:25:18.419 --> 00:25:19.987
