577
00:25:22.556 --> 00:25:25.226
- Jason. Powell. I'm so sorry.

578
00:25:25.292 --> 00:25:26.761
My calendar got crossed.

579
00:25:26.827 --> 00:25:28.562
We're gonna have to
pick this up tomorrow.

580
00:25:28.662 --> 00:25:29.730
- Wait. what?

581
00:25:29.797 --> 00:25:31.232
- No. I'll see you tomorrow.

582
00:25:36.937 --> 00:25:39.673
- So. Clint.
your alibi fell apart.

583
