587
00:25:51.819 --> 00:25:54.955
So I got turned around on
the way back to the hotel.

588
00:25:55.056 --> 00:25:55.923
Is that a crime?

589
00:25:55.990 --> 00:25:58.626
- Okay. so the
problem with that is

590
00:25:58.659 --> 00:26:02.029
