593
00:26:08.169 --> 00:26:10.938
- And you lied about
not knowing Ian Larkin.

594
00:26:11.038 --> 00:26:13.674
- Come on. Clint. it's
pretty hard to forget someone

595
00:26:13.774 --> 00:26:17.645
