over the years?

599
00:26:27.455 --> 00:26:28.923
It's the cost
of doing business.

600
00:26:29.023 --> 00:26:31.560
But everybody wants
a piece of the champ.

601
00:26:31.625 --> 00:26:32.960
- Piece of the champ.

602
00:26:33.094 --> 00:26:36.397
So you're saying that
you're the victim here?

603
00:26:36.497 --> 00:26:39.066
- I ain't the villain.
I'll tell you that.

604
00:26:39.166 --> 00:26:41.702
- Okay. well.
let's say that that's true.

605
00:26:41.735 --> 00:26:44.105
