633
00:28:12.527 --> 00:28:14.962
And you know what?

634
00:28:14.995 --> 00:28:18.065
I think the kid got it.

635
00:28:18.165 --> 00:28:24.805
I think the kid finally
learned his lesson.

636
00:28:24.872 --> 00:28:28.842
right there at the end.

637
00:28:28.909 --> 00:28:33.414
