645
00:28:56.737 --> 00:28:59.541
but it's just that.

646
00:28:59.574 --> 00:29:01.809
It's talk.

647
00:29:01.875 --> 00:29:06.447
And I'm pretty sure you
don't have the evidence

648
00:29:06.480 --> 00:29:07.848
