649
00:29:07.915 --> 00:29:13.020
So if it's all the same.
I'd like my lawyer.

650
00:29:23.565 --> 00:29:25.099
- Well. that was
quite the performance.

651
00:29:25.165 --> 00:29:26.300
- Yeah.

652
00:29:26.367 --> 00:29:28.035
O'Neill may be crazy. but
