658
00:29:35.242 --> 00:29:36.745
- Which means we need more.
What about other victims?

659
00:29:36.777 --> 00:29:37.945
- We tried.

660
00:29:37.978 --> 00:29:39.346
But between it being
so long ago

661
00:29:39.413 --> 00:29:41.782
and there being no real
record of these boys.

662
00:29:41.815 --> 00:29:43.585
I mean. we came up empty.

663
00:29:43.718 --> 00:29:47.187
- Well. either we tie O'Neill
directly to Ian or he walks.

664
00:29:51.425 --> 00:29:53.327
- Razor.

665
00:29:53.394 --> 00:29:54.663
- I already gave my answer.

666
00:29:54.729 --> 00:29:55.929
- I know. I know.

667
00:29:55.996 --> 00:29:57.599
- I'm not changing my mind.
- I know.

668
00:29:57.732 --> 00:29:58.799
- Then what?
What are we doing here?

669
00:29:58.866 --> 00:30:00.134
Because I'm on the clock.

670
00:30:00.267 --> 00:30:01.935
- All right. so I--

671
00:30:01.969 --> 00:30:04.305
I found one of Ian's journals.

672
00:30:04.405 --> 00:30:09.611
And I thought you should
read one of his entries.

673
00:30:09.711 --> 00:30:11.278
Just read it.

674
00:30:14.048 --> 00:30:17.017
- "I'm just tired of it all.
putting on a face.

675
00:30:17.084 --> 00:30:20.254
"going through the motions.
waking up every day.

676
00:30:20.321 --> 00:30:22.524
"And if it weren't for--

677
00:30:22.624 --> 00:30:24.091
- Keep reading.

678
00:30:25.727 --> 00:30:27.529
Look.

679
00:30:27.629 --> 00:30:29.731
"If it weren't for Razor.

680
00:30:29.830 --> 00:30:32.266
"I would have checked out
a long time ago

681
00:30:32.299 --> 00:30:34.368
"because I can't leave him
alone.

682
00:30:34.468 --> 00:30:35.969
"It's just us.

683
00:30:36.003 --> 00:30:37.739
"No one else understands.

684
00:30:37.838 --> 00:30:41.942
"They don't get it. but we do.

685
00:30:41.975 --> 00:30:46.614
"And if I give up. then
the guy who hurts us wins.

686
00:30:46.648 --> 00:30:50.484
And that would piss off
Razor more than anything."

687
00:30:52.986 --> 00:30:54.656
- That's a cheap shot. lady.

688
00:30:54.689 --> 00:30:56.323
- Maybe.

689
00:30:56.457 --> 00:30:58.158
But it's the truth.

690
00:30:58.225 --> 00:31:02.896
And I wish that it weren't
the case. but it is.

691
00:31:03.030 --> 00:31:04.799
Razor. if you
don't come forward.

692
00:31:04.833 --> 00:31:07.535
then O'Neill gets
