693
00:31:07.569 --> 00:31:12.072
everything that he did to you
and everything he did to Ian.

694
00:31:18.847 --> 00:31:21.516
- The state of the room.
along with extensive

695
00:31:21.583 --> 00:31:25.018
subdermal bruising
on the victim's arms and torso.

696
00:31:25.052 --> 00:31:27.187
points to a violent struggle.

697
00:31:27.221 --> 00:31:29.824
- Ian Larkin fought back.
