about his attacker?

704
00:31:47.975 --> 00:31:50.745
- Laryngeal trauma this
severe requires a person

705
00:31:50.812 --> 00:31:53.113
of significant strength.

706
00:31:53.180 --> 00:31:56.216
- Someone like Mr. O'Neill?

707
00:31:56.283 --> 00:31:57.484
- Yes.

708
00:31:57.585 --> 00:31:59.953
