in the New York area?

711
00:32:07.928 --> 00:32:09.430
- Probably not.

712
00:32:09.564 --> 00:32:11.265
- Do you know how many
strong individuals were

713
00:32:11.398 --> 00:32:13.768
in Manhattan at the time
of Mr. Larkin's death?

714
00:32:13.835 --> 00:32:16.003
- No. I couldn't say.

715
00:32:16.069 --> 00:32:17.605
- Fair enough.

716
00:32:17.705 --> 00:32:20.675
Could you say how many unique
DNA samples you recovered

717
00:32:20.708 --> 00:32:22.242
